cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TurnShift in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TurnShift: sequential behavioral-shift detection in conversational AI"
abstract: >
  TurnShift (formerly BehaviorGuard) detects mid-conversation author
  substitution by accumulating per-user embedding residuals with CUSUM.
  It also maintains privacy-preserving user profiles (semantic, linguistic,
  temporal) used by a composite per-message scorer; that scorer is retained
  as a baseline, not as a primary result.
authors:
